KPL/SCLK

Synthetic two-field, two-partition type-1 clock authored for tspice parity tests.
There are 256 ticks per major unit and one TDB second per major unit. The two
partitions share an encoded boundary at tick 1023. These constants model no real
spacecraft or measurements and are distributed under the repository license.

\begindata
SCLK_DATA_TYPE_12345       = ( 1 )
SCLK01_TIME_SYSTEM_12345   = ( 1 )
SCLK01_N_FIELDS_12345      = ( 2 )
SCLK01_MODULI_12345        = ( 1000000 256 )
SCLK01_OFFSETS_12345       = ( 0 0 )
SCLK01_OUTPUT_DELIM_12345  = ( 1 )
SCLK_PARTITION_START_12345 = ( 0 1024 )
SCLK_PARTITION_END_12345   = ( 1023 4095 )
SCLK01_COEFFICIENTS_12345  = ( 0 0 1 )
\begintext
